      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We should propose a \"one-time compliance adjustment\" mechanism for the first 18 months that defers part of the requirement to zero out the upfront capital outlay, creating a \"soft landing\" for the manufacturers without hiding the long-term data. We will present the memo as offering specific \"exemption pathways\" for low-margins to absorb the cost while maintaining overall subsidy integrity, rather than claiming the numbers are negligible. This approach acknowledges the data exists but pivots the conversation to a fair transition strategy that isolates the pilot benefit for your core constituencies.",
